// SR059 negative-edge: ``obj.READY := 1`` is a field assignment, not a
// bare-variable assignment. The target ``obj.READY`` is not a local
// variable; the receiver ``obj`` is genuinely used (read on the LHS to
// locate the field), so neither shape produces an SR059 finding.
obj := getObject("MxThing", "ID42");
obj.READY := 1;
